[9.4863, "o", "\u001b[H\n\u001b[38;2;37;50;74;1mKeyboard help \u00b7 Timeline\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u2191/\u2193 or j/k   read text\u001b[K\r\n  [ / ]        previous/next event\r\n  Enter        expand/collapse technical evidence\u001b[K\r\n  d            inspect selected event\r\n  u            inspect redacted Unknown evidence\u001b[K\r\n  f            rule assessments\r\n  x            derived views and rebuilds\u001b[K\r\n  /            search\r\n\u001b[38;2;180;35;24;1m  r            refresh; retry failed reads\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n  Target       event acted on by Enter, d and u\r\n\u001b[K\n  PgUp/PgDn    scroll a page\r\n  Home/End     first/last row (also g/G)\u001b[K\r\n  Esc          return to previous screen\r\n  ?            close this help\u001b[K\r\n  q / Ctrl-C   quit (Ctrl-C while editing)\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[38;2;37;50;74;1m[FOCUS] Help \u00b7 returns to Timeline\u001b[m\u001b[K\n\u001b[4G\u001b[38;2;102;112;133mscroll \u00b7 PgUp/PgDn \u00b7 g/G ends \u00b7 Esc close \u00b7 ? close\u001b[m\u001b[K"]
